<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-21T02:42:19.983Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:42:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab militants launched a probing attack on Mangai Camp in Lamu and a strike 40 km northwest of Kismayo, prompting a U.S. airstrike on the latter position. Djibouti peacekeepers were killed in a clash with Hawadle militias at Beledweyne airport while Somali intelligence killed nine Al-Shabaab members in Middle Shabelle. The Somali president accused the United Arab Emirates of funding armed groups, ordered the UAE ambassador to leave and recalled Somalia's envoy from Abu Dhabi, leading to a UAE condemnation. Hate crimes against Somalis intensified, with a Somali American Uber driver assaulted after political rhetoric and a community rallying for the victim's family. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPdmF5V2FxNUNfQ1N4Z2RMRU1xYWYxUklnbjZEck5XQWlGRHhCTjdycFhVTExjSHFCVGhzdzlNTTFONUpKSFE5ZXdVdTBaX2R5OUdTME9fQ1AyWVpsaW9aLWxIcGg3SW9DRDlWVkw2QjFUbzF1ZEFmTjEzMmxka0NhUm15SGU4RVhJS1B4TFYxSTZqZGlUWVdFSHdaSDhhZVE2c2lzODRnTmktY3hnTVpHS2U4c2loNFhTb3BveVRYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQX09oeHJVMEswVHNnUXJrdXN0YW90R2d6QURxMXVOVC1HLXk1Z01HUHlRWDA2QTFuTmpUd2xPUnJWTUc1ZjAxS0VaQzhvR3V3U1V2VFhuTVRrQXRpd3E0a0tjYjRiZmNfOWhjYWwtTTkzZnZ4R2lCbXhoNEVJTjhhd0FZQlppZnR1TldCZEdBVG12cUVnSTU1OEZnb1MxOVhZUzJ0ZEwtVjRIQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQSTNiODMzWG9odzRETVdSa2d4cF9kYU1oMVJhSUJwdHRta3VWNmxGa090N1ZzOWpuZlhqOWNiSDFXREFsdkFScUlwcXBQRUlFMVVGTEgwTUxpZ1hUcmI4TkgxS2V4NHo2QTBQb3pJeGRkMVBXZlJUT3ZXalNiUy1QTVlOWnAtZ1pjdkZzdF9DRzlaaEN1eVVuTmNlS24wYmtEaWM1QW9PUDFHaW1pQS1qTVU3LVV3UGJCRl8w?oc=5&quot;&gt;PJ Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/